      "text": "\nCircuit $\\mathrm{C}$ with $\\mathrm{G}=\\mathrm{S}$\n",
      "image": null,
      "isCorrect": false
    },
    {
      "id": "gySWq",
      "text": "\nCircuit $D$ with $\\left.G=\\frac{R S}{(R-S}\\right)$",
